* ADA4177 Inverting Amplifier
Vin IN 0 SINE(0 50m 1k) AC 1
Vcc VCC 0 15
Vee VEE 0 -15

Rin IN N_inv 10k
Rf N_inv OUT 100k

* Genuine ADA4177 Op-Amp Subcircuit (IN+ IN- V+ V- OUT)
X1 0 N_inv VCC VEE OUT ADA4177

* Analysis directives
.tran 0 5m 0 1u
.ac dec 10 10 100k

* Measurements for numeric targets
.meas tran vin_pp PP V(IN) FROM 2m TO 5m
.meas tran vout_pp PP V(OUT) FROM 2m TO 5m
.meas tran gain_db PARAM 20*log10(vout_pp/vin_pp)

.end
